WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.251
In this video, you will sign up for the weekly lights email, one short email a week with the lights and events near a city you choose.

00:00:08.251 --> 00:00:10.693
It is free, and you can stop it any time.

00:00:10.693 --> 00:00:11.856
We start on the map.

00:00:12.757 --> 00:00:16.819
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:16.819 --> 00:00:18.944
That is the only address you need.

00:00:21.272 --> 00:00:23.678
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:23.678 --> 00:00:27.422
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:27.422 --> 00:00:28.760
Tap Use my location.

00:00:30.539 --> 00:00:34.976
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:34.976 --> 00:00:38.181
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:38.181 --> 00:00:42.741
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:46.324 --> 00:00:49.013
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:49.013 --> 00:00:50.208
See the three dots?

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:54.511
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:54.511 --> 00:00:55.049
Tap them.

00:00:56.665 --> 00:00:58.969
In the menu, tap Weekly lights email.

00:01:00.714 --> 00:01:03.158
Type your email address, then your city.

00:01:03.158 --> 00:01:06.913
We use the city to choose which lights and events to send you.

00:01:06.913 --> 00:01:09.595
Then tick the box to agree to get the email.

00:01:09.595 --> 00:01:12.575
It is a free email, once a week, and nothing else.

00:01:14.262 --> 00:01:15.265
Tap Sign up.

00:01:17.429 --> 00:01:19.433
We send you an email to confirm.

00:01:19.433 --> 00:01:24.959
Nothing is sent until you do, and that protects you from anyone signing you up by mistake.

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:26.538
Open it, and tap the link.

00:01:28.598 --> 00:01:29.322
That is it.

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:33.365
You will get one email a week with the lights and events near you.

00:01:33.365 --> 00:01:35.900
And every email ends with a link to stop.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.158
One tap, and you are off the list, no questions asked.

00:01:40.359 --> 00:01:43.111
Next up: Install the app and use it offline.
